# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in. Secrets never go in project files.
#
# This is the *development* path. A shipped build has no checkout to keep a
# .env in and reads a settings file instead — but it is one resolver and one
# order either way: the environment first, the settings file second. Run
# `scorsese settings` to see where that file is and which keys resolved; it
# never prints a key. See docs/credentials.md.

# Veo (video generation) — Gemini API key
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# ElevenLabs (narration, and the voice list to choose from)
#
# A key here can be present, correct, and still refused: ElevenLabs keys carry
# per-scope permissions, granted when the key is made. scorsese needs
# text-to-speech to generate narration and voices_read to list the voices to
# choose from, and a key without the second answers 401 on every listing while
# generating perfectly well. That refusal is reported as what it is — the key
# is fine, the permission is missing, and the fix is in the ElevenLabs
# dashboard rather than in this file.
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
